         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Lombardi Mark (1951-2000): Untitled from the series BCCI, ICIC &amp; FAB, 1996. Pen and ink and electrophotographic print on paper. Sheet: 9 1\16 â—Š 19 11\16in. (23 â—Š 50 cm). Purchase, with funds from the Drawing Committee and the Contemporary Painting and Sculpture Committee. Inv.: 2000.250.7 New York Whitney Museum of American Art *** Permission for usage must be provided in writing from Scala.</rdf:li>
